---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Portrait from "../components/Portrait.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
        <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
        <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
        <title>rioja</title>
    </head>
    <body class="font-sans bg-orange-100 text-amber-950">
        <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 lg:py-16">
            <div class="flex gap-8 items-center mb-12 lg:mb-16 justify-around">
                <div>
                    <h1
                        class="max-w-content text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight"
                    >
                        Hello and <span class="text-amber-600">welcome.</span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="my-4 text-xl leading-relaxed">
                        I'm a technologist and entrepreneur based in Manchester,
                        UK.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                    <Portrait />
                </div>
            </div>
            <div
                class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 mb-12 lg:mb-16"
            >
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-2xl font-bold">
                        The barrier to entry for <span class="text-amber-600"
                            >building software</span
                        > has never been lower.
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        AI has democratized creation, allowing anyone to
                        prototype ideas instantly. With this, we are witnessing
                        an explosion of "good enough" software.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        But in a crowded market, the real challenge isn't just
                        getting something to work  — it's building
                        something that scales, survives, and stands out.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-2xl font-bold">
                        The barrier to <span class="text-amber-600"
                            >success</span
                        > has never been higher.
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        I help founders and organizations bridge the gap between
                        a validated concept and a mature product.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
                        I bring an empiricist’s mindset  — grounded in
                        systems design, quantitative metrics, and product
                        thinking  — to ensure that we are building a
                        scalable product, not just prototypes or vapourware.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
                <a
                    href="/about"
                    class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-amber-600 text-orange-100 font-semibold rounded hover:bg-amber-700 transition-colors mt-4"
                >
                    Learn More &rarr;
                </a>
            </div>
        </main>
    </body>
</html>
